{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37169","headline":"上子男寿昌宰 · 翁洮","name":"上子男寿昌宰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陶公爲政卓潘齐，入县看花柳满堤。\n百里江山聊展骥，九臯云月怪驱鸡。\n高楼野色迎襟袖，比屋歌声远鼓鼙。\n只恐攀辕留不住，明时霄汉有丹梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁洮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}